4. Added timeout to prevent hanging requests
5. Added status code checking with raise_for_status()
6. Wrapped the main functionality in try-except blocks to handle common errors
7. Provided more descriptive error messages

These changes make the code more robust and handle various error cases that could occur during the webfinger retrieval and parsing process.

